; A plugin's line ends at its line break: a string on the next line is no
; configuration of it but a syntax error of its own, and the plugin still
; runs, so the price of the cost below is emitted.
plugin "beancount.plugins.implicit_prices"
"not a configuration"

2020-01-01 open Assets:I

2020-01-02 * "buy"
  Assets:I  1 HOOL {100 USD}
  Assets:I  -100 USD
